---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'
---

<Site
  title="About SEQ Campers"
  description="SEQ Campers - Shane and Maud's Sunshine Coast off-road camper business. Three decades on the lot. Authorised Kimberley Kampers and Stockman dealer."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Off-road experts. Sunshine Coast.</h1>
      <p>Thirty years selling, servicing, and testing off-road campers.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Meet the team -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 32px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Meet the team</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px;">Shane and Maud</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-top:8px;">
          The husband-and-wife team behind SEQ Campers since 1996.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <figure class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo">
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/600x600/2A1608/F4EDE0/png?text=Shane%0A%28Photo+coming%29&font=montserrat"
              alt="Shane - placeholder portrait"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="team-meta">
            <div class="team-name">Shane</div>
            <div class="team-role">Owner · SEQ Campers since 2013</div>
            <p class="team-bio">
              Shane has called SEQ Campers home since 2013 and has been the proud owner since 2019.
              Deep love of the outdoors, hands-on mechanical background. He connects with customers
              as a fellow adventurer who knows exactly what you need out on the road.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo">
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/600x600/C0341A/F4EDE0/png?text=Maud%0A%28Photo+coming%29&font=montserrat"
              alt="Maud - placeholder portrait"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="team-meta">
            <div class="team-name">Maud</div>
            <div class="team-role">Co-owner · Customer Care · Operations</div>
            <p class="team-bio">
              Maud joined Shane in running the business in 2019, bringing a sharp business mind
              and a passion for ethical, people-first service. She makes sure every customer feels
              like part of the SEQ Campers family.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our story + horizontal timeline (consolidated into one section) -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sand-deep); padding-top:48px; padding-bottom:48px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="justify-content:center; text-align:center; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; margin-bottom:24px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Our path here</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Three decades, four chapters</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Prose intro (narrative + quotes) sits above the timeline cards -->
      <div style="max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 36px;">
        <p style="color:var(--ink); line-height:1.75; font-size:1.02rem; margin-bottom:14px;">
          We started this business in 1996 because we loved getting out into the bush
          and we got sick of gear that couldn't keep up. Shane had spent years on the
          tools - building, modifying, fixing - and Maud could talk to anyone, anywhere,
          about anything. We figured if we put those two things together and only sold
          rigs we'd actually take camping ourselves, we'd be alright. Three decades on,
          that's still the rule.
        </p>
        <blockquote style="border-left:3px solid var(--gold); padding:10px 18px; background:#fff; border-radius:4px; color:var(--ink); font-style:italic; margin:18px 0;">
          "If Shane wouldn't take it on a trip, it doesn't go on the floor."
        </blockquote>
        <p style="color:var(--ink); line-height:1.75; font-size:1.02rem; margin-bottom:14px;">
          We've built relationships with the two manufacturers we trust most -
          <strong>Kimberley Kampers</strong> and <strong>Stockman Products</strong> -
          and stuck with them because they build the way we want things built. Tough,
          lightweight where it matters, comfortable where it counts.
        </p>
        <blockquote style="border-left:3px solid var(--rust); padding:10px 18px; background:#fff; border-radius:4px; color:var(--ink); font-style:italic; margin:18px 0 0;">
          "When you buy from us, you get a relationship, not just a receipt."
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <!-- Horizontal timeline cards -->
      <ol class="story-timeline" aria-label="Company history">
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">1996</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Doors open on the Sunshine Coast</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Two demo units, an old service ute, one rule: sell what we'd take camping ourselves.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2000s</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Kimberley Kampers partnership</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Shared values, quality you could feel in the chassis. The backbone of what we stock.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2010s</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Stockman joins the lineup</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Tough, lightweight, purpose-built. The right fit for families going further.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2026</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Thirty years, still going</h3>
          <p class="story-body">2,000+ YouTube subscribers, workshop running flat out, same plan as 1996.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why buy from us - three differentiators -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">
      <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Why buy from us</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:28px;">What you get from us</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Shane doesn't sell what he hasn't used</h3>
          <p>Every model on the floor has been tested, walked through, and inspected. If we wouldn't take it out, you won't see it on the lot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Buy and service in one place</h3>
          <p>The workshop that preps your van is the same one that services it for the next 20 years.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>No rush to close</h3>
          <p>We're not in a hurry to close a sale. We're in a hurry to make sure you walk out with the right van.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
